1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
 - It took me 12 years to master my communication,

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:05,000
 but I'm going to give you the five most powerful lessons

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,240
 in the next 60 seconds.

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,960
 These lessons have allowed me to work

5
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,280
 with some of the biggest companies in the world.

6
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,600
 One, you are not stuck with the way you sound.

7
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:15,040
 Your voice is just a series of behaviors.

8
00:00:15,040 --> 00:00:16,800
 You can change it if you want to.

9
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,480
 Two, your voice is your personality.

10
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,880
 So, you know, if I talk to you like this,

11
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,120
 you'd think that I'm really shy.

12
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,680
 But you see, if I spoke to you like this,

13
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,760
 you'd think I'm a bit of a wanker, don't you?

14
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:28,000
 Your voice is like an instrument, like a piano.

15
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,960
 Stop just speaking like this with one key.

16
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:34,960
 The goal is to explore the entire instrument.

17
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,880
 Oh, I've ran so fast in my life.

18
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:39,480
 Number four, as you explore your voice,

19
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,560
 you're going to start to feel like,

20
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,720
 oh, I'm being fake and phony.

21
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:44,120
 Stop, reframe, not fake and phony.

22
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:46,120
 It's just unfamiliar.

23
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:49,440
 Number five, you are only as good as you can communicate.

24
00:00:49,440 --> 00:00:51,720
 Let's say for example, technically you're a 10 out of 10,

25
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:53,800
 but your communication skills are a three out of 10.

26
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:56,080
 Do you think people perceive you to be a 10 out of 10

27
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,280
 or a three out of 10?

28
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:00,720
 Again, you are only as good as you can communicate.

29
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,960
 So if you want to improve your communication skills,

30
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,920
 I share practical tips every single week.

31
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:05,840
 Follow me for more.

